&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;2012-2학기 대학원(일반, 산업, 교육 및 컨설팅) 졸업종합시험 과목을 붙임과 같이 공지하오니 기한 내 응시원서를 제출하여 주시기 바랍니다.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">1. 응시원서 제출 기간 : </span><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">2012. 09. 28(금) ~ 10. 05(금) [4일간]</span></u></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">2. 응시원서 제출 장소 : 해당 학과(전공) 종합학사행정실</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">3. 제출서류 : 졸업종합시험 응시원서 1부</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">※ 유의사항 1 </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">1) 시험은 동일교수의 과목만으로 시행할 수 없습니다.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp; (불합격 과목 응시자는 합격한 내용 확인 후 시험 응시서류 제출)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp; ex) 석/박사과정 모두 문제출제 교수가 반드시 2명 이상이어야 함</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">2) 과목수를 학기별로 나누어 시행할 수 없습니다.&nbsp; (대학원 학위수여 규정 제2장 제5조 4항)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp; (첫 응시자는 박사 4과목/석사3과목 모두 응시해야 합니다.)</span>&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">&nbsp;※ 유의사항 2 : </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">대학원 간 교차 응시 불가능</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp; [</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">일반대학원(석/박사) 또는 특수대학원(산업, 교육 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">및 컨설팅)학생이 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">본교 다른 대학원에서 지정한 과목에는 응시할 수 없음.</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">]</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">붙임 1. 2012-2학기 대학원(</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">일반, 산업, 교육 및 컨설팅</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">) 졸업종합시험 과목 각 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">1부.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 2.졸업종합시험 응시원서(서식) 1부. 끝. </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 2\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">2012. 09.</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 2\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 2\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">금오공과대학교 대학원(일반, 산업, 교육 및 컨설팅)장</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
